# Test Case: Merge after split (two replicas)
#
# This tests merging ranges after a split, with two replicas:
# 1. Initialize 2-store cluster
# 2. Flush and add replica
# 3. Split (lhs=1, rhs=2)
# 4. Flush both ranges
# 5. Verify state on both stores
# 6. Merge ranges back
# 7. Verify state on both stores after merge

init stores=2
----
cluster started with 2 store(s)

scratch-range
----
ok

# Flush before adding replica.
flush rangeID=1 store=1
----
